message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata from this file."
type: software
title: "RhiZimon Image Processing Pipeline"
abstract: >-
  A three-step GUI-based pipeline for dewarping and stitching minirhizotron
  images. It allows users to calibrate a distortion correction using control
  point pairs, apply it in batch using thin-plate spline RBF interpolation,
  and stitch the corrected images into continuous root profiles.
